window.products.push({"id":1135108,"name":"Universal Round Lid for Pots,Pans and Skillets,Tempered Glass with Heat Resistant Silicone Rim Fits 10 To 12 inches,With Kitchen Dishcloths,Cookware U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mKHXdQA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥘Food Grade Tempered Glass & Silicone Universal Pot lids🥘Our universal skillet lids are made of food-grade silicone and tempered glass, really sturdy, durable, and environment-friendly. The food-grade silicone is for the lid rim and tempered glass for the main lid body. If this pot lid falls down by accident, its soft silicone rim will protect the pan lid from breaking,Safe and sturdy protection, you can use it with confidence! 🥘3 in 1 Universal Lid for Pots and Pans🥘The most special point of our pot lids is that it is universal lid for stock pots, saucepans, frying pans, casserole, skillets, cast iron pans, woks, pots, and other common cookware. 3 in 1 lids it can be used for three sizes of cookware: 9.5inches, 10 inches, 11inches,Save your household expenses perfect frying pan lids. 🥘Perfect Unique Handle Match Spatulas Pan Cover🥘Our handle is designed by international professional ergonomic designers.The top of the handle has a streamlined groove to enhance the touch of the hand. At the same time, the spatula can be placed on the handle to solve the problem that the spatula occupies the kitchen Countertop troubles when you use it. Let you enjoy the convenience and joy of when you cooking foods. 🥘 Easy to Clean & Save Space Pot Lids🥘This toughened glass and silicone universal lids for pots and pans are really easy to clean under water tap, and it's dishwasher safe for more convenience. No worries about how to place dozens of covers to match each of your pots and pans. With only one universal pot lid cover, you get this annoying problem done. It helps save more space and make your kitchen more organized! 🥘Kitchen Cleaning Cloth & Professional Seller Customer Service🥘We have delivered free rags, you can clean your pot covers, pots, bowls, etc., making cleaning simple. At the same time,we have professional customer service for sellers. If you have any problems during the shopping process, please contact us in time. You won't lose anything!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mKHXdQA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sibicon","source_asin":"B0BTCPVXHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCPVXHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTCPVXHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
