window.products.push({"id":1135253,"name":"Riverside Furniture Medley Drop Leaf Dining Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tGBys9cVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Compact and versatile the Medley Drop-Leaf Dining Table transforms from a rectangular to a square table and back again. It is perfect for apartments lofts and smaller living spaces. The table's wood-framed marquetry in a pebble mosaic pattern makes an artistic statement along with the twisted metal legs and unique interlocking metal stretchers. The Medley is constructed of mindi hardwood solids and veneers in a lightly distressed wood finish. Assembly required. Dimensions: 40L x 20-40W x 30H inches. With leaf extended table is 40 x 40 in. square. This purchase is for dining table only please see \"Related Items\" for matching chairs or complete dining set. About Riverside FurnitureThe Arkansas River Valley is home to majestic forests ruggedly beautiful mountains gurgling brooks and swiftly flowing rivers. It is also home to Riverside Furniture Corporation. Riverside has been growing for more than half a century. The company's founder Herman Udouj opened the doors to his first factory in 1946 and along with 12 employees he began making hand-crafted furniture for the post-World War II Baby Boom era. Since then three generations of Americans have furnished their homes and offices with Riverside's wide range of furniture products. Riverside strives to be trusted for quality products that are an affordable value. It's just that simple.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tGBys9cVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riverside","source_asin":"B003K0I4N2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003K0I4N2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003K0I4N2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
