window.products.push({"id":1135555,"name":"HB 6' Foot Oil Lamp Flat Wick, 1\" Inch Wide Cotton Lantern Wick Oil Lantern for Kerosene Lamps & Paraffin Oil Wick (6 Foot Roll)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJI0Ib2PL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL : The oil wick lamp is made up of strong flat cotton material that ensure a bright flame and even tempered burn, safe to use, easy to light, which can last for a long time. SIZE : 1 Roll of 1 Inch(width) ; roll length approx. 6 Foot (1.8 meters). EASY TO CUT : Hell blues cotton wick roll measures approx. 1.8 m/ 6 feet, you can cut it to any length as per your need. Correct ignition and burning can ensure a bright flame and prolong the burning speed. FUNCTIONAL : Hell Blues oil lamp wick can be applied for different types of lanterns and lamps, which will help to provide a beauty and serenity surroundings for you and your family members. Great for indoor and outdoor, camping or hiking, allow you to enjoy the beautiful night scene. NOTE：Please immerse the wick in oil for half an hour, and then ignite the wick after it is soaked to avoid smoking and flickering; Please remember to put out the lamp when you leave, and keep them away from children. If you change fuel types, its recommended you change to a new wick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJI0Ib2PL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hell Blues","source_asin":"B0BFXGHK4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFXGHK4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFXGHK4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
