window.products.push({"id":1135771,"name":"Zak Designs Hammered Goblets, Sky Blue, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tjbaD+CFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four translucent Hammered Goblets in sky blue, from Zak Designs offer a simple, modern shape that is both functional and elegant for indoor or outdoor entertaining. Constructed of durable SAN clear plastic, the goblets provide a glass look without the risk of breakage. The 14-ounce stemmed goblets feature a hammered texture that is easy to hold and are great for serving wine and water. The goblets are BPA-free, shatterproof and top-rack dishwasher safe. This set of goblets coordinates well with other Zak Designs dinnerware and serveware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tjbaD+CFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B00I0GTT76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I0GTT76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I0GTT76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1135772,"name":"Cthulhu Crest Themed Bath Towels, Hand Towels and Wash Cloths","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SLN4FYgiL.jpg","description":"This Urban Threads Design works perfectly stitched onto this 16\" x 25\" black velour/terry hand towel. All towels are washed prior to leaving my shop at least once if not twice. The first time to reduce shrinkage, as we all know towels shrink, and the second to remove any residue from the embroidery process. my listing photos reflect the washed towels so what you see is what you get, no stock photos here. Due to many requests I am now offering this design on bath towels, hand towel and wash cloths too! So go ahead and build yourself an entire Cthulhu bathroom set! Full towel sets are heavy and require a medium flat rate box to ship. The high towel cost is based mainly on the shipping cost. I can do this set in many other color requests feel free to convo me for a special order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SLN4FYgiL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01E63QRG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E63QRG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E63QRG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1135773,"name":"SAT AMERICANA Bath Towel Blue Hotel Spa Gym Pool Yoga Lightweight Soft Absorbent Quick Drying Multipurpose Combed Cotton Bath Towel Set Daily Use Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z58jai6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Pure Cotton Material Made from 100-percent cotton, the towels not only feel soft to the touch and smooth against skin, but it also stands up over time, offering tear-resistant strength. Genuine Cotton, being one of the most uniquely produced natural fibers worldwide provides our daily lives with the comfort that you can find in high end hotel towels. Our extra long bath towels have a capacity to remain unbelievably soft while remaining highly absorbent, after every wash. Skin Friendly Materials like microfiber and cotton, are the most popular fabrics used for face cloths and they are also and ideal option for full size towels for the body.The natural fabric makes our luxe towel, more gentle and smoother on your skin they are super soft and plush and the softness of these towels ensure comfort in your daily lives. Easy Wash Care Machine washable Tumble dry low Rinse and dry immediately after wash Wash new towels before first use Dont leave them to dry in the sun for too long Do not iron the towels Dont use fabric softeners","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z58jai6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAT AMERICANA","source_asin":"B08MBDMFMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MBDMFMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MBDMFMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
