window.products.push({"id":1135782,"name":"POWEART Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with 30Kpa Powerful Suction, 350W Rechargeable Vacuum Cleaner with 8-Cell 2600mAh Battery, 8-in-1 Cordless Stick Vacuu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ppREaW0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【350W Brushless Motor & 8-Cell 2600mAh Battery】POWEART N700 cordless stick vacuum cleaner is equipped with an upgraded motor and 8*2600mAh built-in battery, it is very efficient and supports 2 power modes. MAX speed carries up to 30KPa powerful suction to pick up debris like pet hair and cat litter from both hard floors and carpets. The standard speed supports longer runtime of about 30-50min; the high-speed mode with stronger suction supports about 15-25min. 【High-Efficient Motorized Brush & Bendable Rod】The main floor brush has a motorized beater roller and 5 front LED lights, providing a better cleaning experience. The roller adopts a V-shaped wave design, picking up dust and dirt more efficiently than the traditional roller. The roller is equipped with both soft and stiff fibers, suitable for both hard floors and carpets. The extension rod is 180° bendable, ideal for cleaning areas under furniture, and also convenient for storage. 【Versatile & Lightweight & Quiet】The stick vacuum cordless is easy to operate with no cord to pull around; it can convert to a handheld vacuum cleaner easily. Extra tools include a flexible hose, a 2-in-1 crevice tool, and a wide cleaning brush for versatile cleaning of cars, curtains, stairs, etc. Noise reduction makes this vacuum pet-friendly. The main vacuum cleaner body weighs about 3.2 pounds, more lightweight than most vacuums of its size, causing less stress on your back. 【Efficient Filtration & Extra Filter】Stick vacuum cleaner cordless has an efficient filtration system that can capture and filter microscopic dust particles, keeping a clean healthy home for your family. The filter and strainer also protect the vacuum cleaner motor, ensuring the vacuum operates at peak efficiency, so please clean the filter regularly and replace it if it's worn out. Filters are washable, please dry them before using them again. An extra filter is attached as a backup. 【Easy to Operate & Convenient Storage】Attached a wall mount for storing the cordless vacuum cleaner and its accessories. One click can empty the dust cup of this rechargeable vacuum. Attach a helpful gadget for cleaning the dust cup and rollers. The POWEART vacuum cleaner is well made and we back it with a worry-free warranty and a dedicated Customer Support Team, please contact us if you have any questions about the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ppREaW0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWEART","source_asin":"B0C8JQ63QJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8JQ63QJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8JQ63QJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
