window.products.push({"id":1135839,"name":"Household Essentials Double Hang Folding Garment Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQVPmGkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Double Hang Folding Garment Rack is an extendable garment rack that really has some hanging power. The Double Hang has two hanging bars. The top bar extends from 43\" to 60\", providing ample hanging space. Moreover, the second bar that can be placed in up to 3 positions on the A-frame rack and creates an additional 33\" of hanging space. The garment rack's A-frame design provides extra stability. The garment rack has a shelf on the bottom, which folds in half to draw the A-frame together for storage. With rolling casters for hanging on the go, this Double Hang Garment Rack provides the space you need where you need it. The A-frame design differs from the standard garment rack. It is larger and thus holds more garments than a standard rack. Its triangular design allows hanging garments to hang freely on both the upper and lower hanging bars. The upper bar extends by pulling either end of the bar out. This versatility means you use on the space you need. The lower bar snaps onto the frame over preformed holes to secure the bar in place. The bar can be placed at 3 different heights to accommodate a variety of clothes and linens. The rolling castors keep the unit movable, making it a worthy addition to yard sales, laundry rooms and more. A shelf on the bottom catches garment that might fall from a hanger, protecting your freshly laundered or stored items from the ground or floor. When not in use, the Double Hang Folding Garment Rack folds neatly. By drawing the bottom shelf up, the A-frame collapses to a tall, thin rack that can be tucked away more easily. Use it for yard sales or in guest rooms. Keep one in the basement for seasonal and coats. It is a convenient, lightweight way to clear closets and store clothing for when you need it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQVPmGkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B00KTMA888","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KTMA888","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KTMA888","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1135840,"name":"Kaufman - Beach Towel, Soft, Plush 100% Cotton Velour Large Size 30”x60” Absorbent, Quick Dry, Horizontal Stripe Beach, Pool and Bath Towels (4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JqOwauzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the soft, durable, and absorbent high-quality material in this horizontal velour striped beach towels 30'' x 60''. Its rich and ultra-plush feel will instantly brighten up your day, combined with vivid, unique colors that make this towel pleasant to both look at and use daily. These classic horizontal stripes fit perfectly in your family vacation to the beach, your home poolside, or even the bathroom or other home uses. Guaranteed comfort, style, and high quality. The horizontal velour stripes bring a cool and distinct feel to a soft and highly absorbent towel set, perfect for the pool, beach, spa, and any daily use. These high-quality towels offer: - A superb luxurious feel.  - Value, unlike any other set sold online.  - 100% Combed ring-spun weave for a luxurious feeling  - Superb absorbency and comfort. Washing Instructions - Wash towels separately from other items of clothing to help decrease the transfer of towel lint to other pieces of clothing. - Use cold water to wash towels to avoid color bleeding. - Always use a mild detergent when washing towels. You may use a larger amount of detergent on towels that are heavily soiled. - Do not use fabric softeners. They may decrease the fluffiness and life of your towel by breaking down the fabric. - Do not use bleach at any stage of washing or drying. Doing so may discolor your towels and damage the fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JqOwauzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEN KAUFMAN SALES CO","source_asin":"B085WBY11Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085WBY11Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085WBY11Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
