window.products.push({"id":1135886,"name":"Nuovoware Digital Kitchen Timer, Digital Loud Alarm Timer with Large LCD Display and Strong Magnetic Back for Cooking Baking, Minute Second Count Up a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tBI3jvMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH DESIGN: It's a well-built timer with minute and second, start/ stop button and on/off switch, easy to operate. LARGE LCD DISPLAY: You can read the large and clear display numbers easily. Ideal for people whose eyesight is poor. COUNTS UP AND DOWN: A perfect timer for homework, exercise, gym workout, cooking, sports, games and office timer activities. Maximum time is 99 minutes, 59 seconds. LOUD SOUNDING ALARM: The sound is loud and clear but not deafening, which can be heard easily even in another room. MAGNETIC BACK & RETRACTABLE STAND & HOOK FOR HANGING: With magnetic back, you can stick it to any metal parts such as fridge door. A retractable stand for keeping the timer standing up on the counter or table. A hook on the back help you to hang the timer anywhere you want by running a piece of string through it. 1-Year Warranty. Nuovoware Digital Kitchen Timer: This Nuovoware Digital Kitchen Timer is made of durable ABS plastic, super easy to use and portable to carry. With large LCD display and loud alarm soud, this timer memorizes the time for you effectively and keep things moving forward. It will be a reliable partner in your life, kitchen cooking, homework, sports, experiments and ect. Features: * Stylish design and compact. Easy to use * Large LCD Display and clear digits * 60 Seconds (S) alarm time * Countup and countdown timer * Loud and audible alarm * Maximum setting time: 99 minutes 59 seconds * Time unit: Min and Sec * With timer memory recall function * With Strong Magnetic back, retractable stand and hook for hanging * With On/Off Switch, Start/Stop, Minutes and Seconds Button Settings: * Turn on the kitchen timer by pushing the switch on the right side upwards. * Select the minutes and the seconds that you want to count down by pressing M and S buttons, and then hit the ST/SP button to start and stop the countdown. Press ST/SP button to stop alarm. * Another way to set the time: keep pressing down the M or S button, the number of minute and second will increase continuously. * Press the M and S button at the same time to reset timer.(The LCD display will show \"\"00.00\"\") Then hit the ST/SP button to count up and pause. * Turn off the kitchen timer by pushing the switch on the right side downwards. Specifications: Material: ABS Plastic Dimension: 3.2 x 3 x 0.75 inches LCD screen: 2.56 x 1.3 inches Weight: 2.44 ounces Power: 1 * AAA 1.5V Battery(Not included) Package: 1 * Nuovoware Digital Kitchen Timer UPC: 782301281561","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tBI3jvMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuovoware","source_asin":"B01MRP6AU1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRP6AU1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRP6AU1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
