window.products.push({"id":1135916,"name":"Technogel Travel Pillow (Travel Collar)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QXjnuVULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experiencing a good night’s sleep can be a transformative experience. You wake up feeling rejuvenated. And you have a more positive attitude throughout the day. The Technogel Sleeping range of pillows not only harmonize with your body, but also your mattress to create a perfect sleeping system. Technogel Sleeping combines the innovative material of Technogel with innovative and ergonomic design to bring you a sleep experience that makes the rest extraordinary.  The perfect blend With a layer of Technogel molded seamlessly to memory foam, our pillows gradually adjust to your shape, creating a sleeping experience that’s unsurpassed. In fact, in a pressure distribution test performed in Japan, Technogel pillows offered a greater decrease in pressure concentration and a wider contact surface than other pillows. The result? More support. More comfort. And a more refreshed you to greet the day. Cool Factor All Technogel Sleeping Pillows offer an enjoyable cool feeling, thanks to Technogel‘s excellent thermal conductivity. It naturally disperses your body heat, helping to lower your skin temperature and keep you comfortable so you can rest longer.  Artfully Crafted Made in Italy with close attention to detail, Technogel pillows are biocompatible, non-toxic and odor free.  - Technogel molded to memory foam base - Superior pressure relief - Cooling effect - Ergonomic support - Biocompatible, non-toxic, odor free - Soft, washable winter cover included - 3-year warranty - Size: 12\" x 10.6\" x 3.3\"  - Made in Italy Benefits: Pressure relief, Cooling Surface, Ergonomic support,Hypo-allergenic, 3D conformation evenly distributes body pressure","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QXjnuVULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Technogel","source_asin":"B009VKG5SQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009VKG5SQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009VKG5SQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
