window.products.push({"id":1135920,"name":"Casa Z The Original Mini Bob Planter Quartet Meditating Resting Sitting Laying - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eKgCNAwcS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Original The Bob planter collection is perfect for that corner in your home that you`d like to give a little more life and transform it into a focal point.All of our products are printed in 3D and are exclusively designed by Casa Z.DIMENSIONS:Meditating Bob Height: 4.3\" Width: 4.1\" Lenght: 3.7\" Head Diameter: 2.9\"Resting Bob Height: 4.3\" Width: 3.5\" Lenght: 5.1\" Head Diameter: 2.9\"Laying Bob Height: 3.9\" Width: 2.7\" Lenght: 6.5\" Head Diameter: 2,9\"Sitting Bob Height: 6.5in Width: 3.5\" Lenght: 3.5\" Head Diameter: 2.9\"MATERIAL:The material used is PLA (Polylactic Acid), a polymer derived from cornstarch or sugar cane, making 100% biodegradable and non-toxic.*plants not includedPRODUCTION PROCESS:Our products are printed in 3D and go through a rigorous quality inspection process before being shipped. TIP: This planter is ideal for mini succulents or used empty for decoration. CARE AND UPKEEP: The objects can be damaged if exposed to high temperatures or direct sunlight for prolonged periods. The objects should not be washed with soap, detergents or similar products. Avoid contact with lotions pomades or similar products. Use a damp cloth for cleaning. The object will be exchanged if there is a manufacturing defect. PRODUCTION TIME Our production process takes between 7-9 business days depending on demand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eKgCNAwcS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casa Z","source_asin":"B091TZ6SY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TZ6SY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TZ6SY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
