window.products.push({"id":1135964,"name":"UniKeep Coaster/Beer Mat Collection Case with Protective Pages to Hold Up to 60 Coasters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlEAltRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drink coasters were invented in Germany in the 19th century as a cheap way to protect pints from dust and bugs. Wealthy bar patrons used steins with lids, but the working class lid was a piece of felt, or bierdeckel. Todays coasters have evolved into pieces of art made in an array of shapes and sizes. Whether you call them drink coasters, beverage coasters or beer mats, these colorful pieces of bar ephemera are collected and treasured all over the world. If youre a coaster collector, try the new UniKeep Coaster Collection Binder. Its designed especially for collectors to be easy and fun to use. This case-style binder snaps closed so you wont have to worry about losing your coasters. Your collection is stored in one place, so you dont have to keep searching all over for a particular coaster. Plus, the included page protectors have pockets that are sized just right to protect coasters from moisture and the elements. You can easily locate and identify your coasters, and show them off to friends and family. Your colorful collection remains vibrant for years to come with UniKeep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlEAltRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniKeep","source_asin":"B07PH3QNSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1135964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PH3QNSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PH3QNSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
